sq8l: SQ8L is a 64-bit, multi platform rebuild of Siegfried Kullmann's
sq8l: SQ8L plugin, a freeware emulation of the Ensoniq SQ-80 synthesizer.
sq8l: The sound engine and editor reproduce the original exactly.
sq8l:
sq8l: Built as LV2, VST2, VST3 and CLAP plugins.
